---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="GearCompared Privacy Policy — we don't collect your data">
  <main class="content">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.85rem;margin-bottom:24px;">Last updated: May 17, 2026</p>

    <h2>Our Approach to Privacy</h2>
    <p>GearCompared does not collect, store, or process any personal data from visitors. We don't use cookies, we don't have user accounts, we don't have comment sections, and we don't track you across the web.</p>
    <p>This site is a static content website — we publish product comparisons and buying guides. That's it.</p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>We use a self-hosted instance of Umami Analytics to understand how many people visit our pages. Umami is cookie-free, GDPR-compliant by design, and does not collect any personally identifiable information. It only records: page URL visited, referrer, country (from anonymized IP, not stored), browser type, and device type. No IP addresses are stored. No unique user IDs are created.</p>

    <h2>Affiliate Links</h2>
    <p>When you click a product link on GearCompared and make a purchase on Amazon.com, Amazon may place cookies on your device to track that we referred you. These cookies are set by Amazon (not by us) and are governed by <a href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GX7NJQ4ZB8MHFRNJ">Amazon's Privacy Notice</a>.</p>

    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>This site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may process visitor IP addresses for security purposes (DDoS protection). See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare's Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>Your Rights Under GDPR</h2>
    <p>Since we don't collect any personal data, there is no data to access, rectify, delete, or port. If you have questions, contact us — but we genuinely have nothing to show you because we don't collect anything.</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>This site is not directed at children under 13 and does not knowingly collect any information from children.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy questions: privacy@gearcompared.com</p>
    <p>Operator: Rasmus Eland, Denmark. This site is operated as a personal project under Danish law.</p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
